('Abhinav Chaturvedi','Partner','Accel',array['$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M','$10M - $50M']::text[],array['Generalist','AI','Developer Tools','Cybersecurity','Enterprise','FinTech','Digital Health','B2C/E-Commerce']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Series B+']::text[],true,null,null,array['US/Canada','Africa','Latin America','India','Asia-Pacific','Europe','Israel','Australia/New Zealand','Middle East','North Africa']::text[],'https://twitter.com/abhinavc','https://www.linkedin.com/in/abhinavchaturvedi/','Abhinav Chaturvedi joined Accel in 2012. Prior to joining Accel, Abhinav held engineering and product management positions at Amazon.com where he built online payment systems. Abhinav holds an MBA from Harvard Business School and a Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science and Engineering from the Indian Institute of Technology, Roorkee.','India','2023-04-20T23:35:58.000Z'::timestamptz),
('Adam Besvinick','Founder and Managing Partner','Looking Glass Capital',array['$100K - $500K']::text[],array['Climate','Creator Economy','Education','Healthcare/Medtech','B2B SaaS','HRTech','SMB Software','Energy','Digital Health','Marketplaces','Parenting/Families']::text[],array['Seed','Pre-seed','Series A']::text[],true,'Ease; BigId; One Concern; Transfix; Winnie; Framework; Hone; Inkbox; NomNom; Plant Prefab; Datmo; VIVE Style; VSporto','adam@lookingglass.vc',array['US/Canada']::text[],'https://twitter.com/besvinick','https://www.linkedin.com/in/besvinick/','Adam Besvinick is the founder of Looking Glass Capital. He has led investments in companies ranging from pre-product to Series C throughout his career and has worked closely with founders at each of those stages and beyond. Prior to forming Looking Glass in 2019, Adam invested in Series A and later companies at Anchorage Capital Group and in seed stage companies at Deep Fork Capital. Prior to starting Looking Glass, he made pre-seed and seed investments in companies including Transfix, BigID, One Concern, Ease, Winnie, StatMuse, Oasis, Primer, Invisible Universe, and Rebel (acquired by Salesforce). He also has made early stage investments in NomNom (acquired by Mars), Plant Prefab, Inkbox (acquired by BIC), and Carrot.','New York, New York','2023-04-29T10:22:18.000Z'::timestamptz),
