('Adam Valkin','Managing Director','General Catalyst',array['$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M','$10M - $50M']::text[],array['Consumer','Social Media','Digital Health','Enterprise','Web3','FinTech']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Series B+']::text[],true,'Truss; Remesh; Rebag; YPlan; Brainly; Fiverr.com; Qriously Technologies; flok; Ro; Classpass; Hopin','avalkin@generalcatalyst.com',array['Latin America','India','US/Canada']::text[],'https://twitter.com/adamvalkin','https://www.linkedin.com/in/adamvalkin/','Adam invests broadly in consumer Internet and SaaS companies in the US and Europe. He enjoys spending time with founders attempting to fundamentally upgrade the customer experience in large consumer verticals like food, automotive, healthcare, banking & payments, insurance, education, gaming, and fitness. He previously served as a venture partner in the London office of Accel Partners, and co-found two companies in London with successful exits, LOVEFiLM (acquired by Amazon) and Propertyfinder (acquired by Zoopla). Adam spent much of career focusing on emerging ecosystems such as NYC, London, Stockholm, Tel Aviv, Paris, and Berlin.','Cambridge, Massachusetts','2023-04-20T23:03:06.000Z'::timestamptz),
('Adeyemi Ajao','Managing Partner','Workday
