('Andrew Hedin','Partner','Bessemer Venture Partners',array['$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M','$10M - $50M','$50M+']::text[],array['BioTech','Consumer Health','Health & Hospital Services','Health IT','Consumer','AI','Developer Tools','Cybersecurity','Digital Health','FinTech']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Series B+']::text[],true,'Kymera Therapeutics; Hinge',null,array['US/Canada','Israel','Asia-Pacific','Europe']::text[],'https://twitter.com/andrewhedin','https://www.linkedin.com/in/andrewhedin/','Andrew Hedin is a partner in Bessemer’s Cambridge office. Prior to joining Bessemer in 2015, Andrew worked at F-Prime Capital, Fidelity’s healthcare-focused venture capital fund where he invested in early-stage biotech and digital health technologies, as well as Leerink Partners as an advisor to the biopharma industry. He earned an MBA with honors from The Wharton School, where he majored in health care management and finance, as well as a degree in biological basis of behavior from the University of Pennsylvania.','Boston, Massachusetts','2023-04-20T23:03:06.000Z'::timestamptz),
('Andrew McCormack','General Partner','Valar Ventures',array['$100K - $500K','$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M','$0 - $100K']::text[],'{}',array['Seed','Series A','Series B+']::text[],true,'Petal',null,array['US/Canada','Europe']::text[],'http://twitter.com/andrewjmack','http://www.linkedin.com/in/drewmccormack','Andrew is a founding Partner at Valar Ventures. Andrew’s career in technology has included business and corporate development roles at eCount (acquired by Citicorp) and Yahoo!. He joined PayPal in 2001, where he worked closely with Peter. After PayPal’s sale to eBay, Andrew helped launch Clarium Capital and later founded a restaurant group in San Francisco. In 2008, Andrew rejoined Peter at Thiel Capital, where he led various international initiatives for Thiel Capital and Peter personally.','New York, New York','2023-04-17T19:41:54.000Z'::timestamptz),
('Andrew McLoughlin','Partner','Uncork Capital',array['$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M']::text[],array['Developer Tools','Enterprise','Productivity','B2B SaaS','FinTech']::text[],array['Seed']::text[],false,'Crossbeam; Focal Systems; Fountain; Human Interest; LaunchDarkly; Coder; Sym; Tailscale','andy@uncorkcapital.com',array['US/Canada']::text[],'https://twitter.com/bandrew','https://www.linkedin.com/in/andymcloughlin/','Andy is a partner at Uncork Capital, a seed fund based in the San Francisco Bay Area, where he focuses on investing in seed-stage B2B software companies. Prior to joining Uncork in 2015, Andy was a co-founder of Huddle, a London-based enterprise collaboration platform that was acquired in 2017. Andy was also an active angel investor with a personal portfolio of 40+ startups including Intercom; Pipedrive; Intercom; Tray.io; Bugsnag; Calm; and Postmates. Born and raised in the UK, Andy was awarded an OBE in the 2015 Queen’s birthday honors list for services to the UK technology industry. He is a co-founder and US Trustee of the Founders Pledge and founding board member of GBx, a network for British technology entrepreneurs in the Bay Area.','San Francisco, California','2023-04-20T23:03:06.000Z'::timestamptz),
