('Anne Lee Skates','Partner','Andreessen Horowitz',array['$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M','$10M - $50M']::text[],array['Education','Future of Work','Marketplaces','Consumer','AI','Developer Tools','Cybersecurity','Web3','DeepTech','BioTech','Digital Health','FinTech','AR/VR','B2C/E-Commerce','Gaming/eSports']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Series B+']::text[],true,null,null,array['Asia-Pacific','US/Canada']::text[],'https://twitter.com/anneleeskates','https://www.linkedin.com/in/anneleeprinceton','Anne was previously a seed stage investor at Floodgate, where she sourced and led several consumer investments. Before that she worked as an early hire in product and engineering roles at two startups, Solv Health and FundersClub. She started her career in consulting at McKinsey in San Francisco. Anne graduated from Princeton University, magna cum laude, where she started a failed company and experienced a taste of the challenges of entrepreneurship first-hand.','San Francisco, California','2023-04-21T05:38:30.000Z'::timestamptz),
