('David Pakman','Managing Partner','CoinFund',array['$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M','$10M - $50M']::text[],array['Advertising','AI','Cloud Infrastructure','Media/Content','Social Networks','Consumer','B2C/E-Commerce','Web3']::text[],array['Series A','Series B+','Pre-seed','Seed']::text[],true,'Dapper Labs; Simbe Robotics; 3Box; Amino Apps; Pearl; Dollar Shave Club; Narvii; YouNow',null,array['US/Canada']::text[],'https://www.twitter.com/pakman','https://www.linkedin.com/in/dpakman/','As a Partner at Venrock in New York, David focuses on early stage venture investing in internet and digital media companies. His active investments include Dstillery (formerly Media6Degrees), Smartling, Dollar Shave Club, YouNow, Amino and Burner. He served on the Board of Crunchyroll (acquired by The Chernin Group) and led Venrock’s investment inKlout, which was acquired by Lithium Technologies.','New York, New York','2023-04-22T04:56:58.000Z'::timestamptz),
