('David Schenkein','General Partner','GV',array['$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M','$10M - $50M']::text[],array['BioTech','Pharmaceuticals','Enterprise','Consumer','DeepTech']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Series B+']::text[],true,'Aera Therapeutics',null,array['US/Canada','Europe']::text[],'https://twitter.com/schenkein','https://www.linkedin.com/in/david-schenkein-md-45342476/','David co-leads GV’s life science investment team, where his interests include therapeutics, diagnostics, medical devices, novel care delivery systems, and payer innovation. David has been a hematologist and medical oncologist for over 30 years, and his focus has always been on people and impact.','Boston, Massachusetts','2023-04-22T05:11:03.000Z'::timestamptz),
