('Konstantine Buhler','Partner','Sequoia Capital',array['$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M','$10M - $50M','$50M+']::text[],array['AI','Enterprise','Developer Tools','BioTech','Consumer']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Series B+']::text[],true,'Canvas; CaptivateIQ; Citadel Securities; Data.ai; Ethos; Kumo.AI; Skiff; Verkada','konstantine@sequoiacap.com',array['US/Canada']::text[],'https://www.twitter.com/KostaBuhler','https://www.linkedin.com/in/konstantinebuhler/','I care about integrity, honesty and directness. I also look for determination, persistence and grit. I constantly remind my founders that if you persist, you will succeed. I’m also not afraid to say that love is a big part of my life. I’m not going to be just a partner or even a friend. I’m striving to bring love to you and your company in every interaction. One theme in my partnerships is virtuous data cycles—businesses where as they accumulate customers, their data becomes more valuable over time. There are lots of AI companies like that, and it can be completely non-obvious.','Palo Alto, California','2023-04-29T14:24:35.000Z'::timestamptz),
