('Kristin (Stannard) Kent','Principal','Expa',array['$100K - $500K','$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M']::text[],array['Future of Work','Supply Chain','FinTech']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Pre-seed']::text[],false,'Convoy; Current; Fabric; Forward; Yumi',null,array['Europe','Latin America','US/Canada']::text[],'https://twitter.com/kstankent','https://www.linkedin.com/in/kristinstannard/','Kristin Kent is a Principal at Expa based in LA, investing in and supporting talented pre-seed founders. Prior to joining Expa, Kristin led product and design teams at 3D home design company Modsy. She has also held growth, product marketing, and business development roles for early-stage startups Calm, Foursquare, Bloom Energy, and Rocket Fuel. A graduate of Stanford University, she played varsity soccer and graduated with a B.S. in Civil & Environmental Engineering.','Los Angeles, California','2023-04-20T23:03:06.000Z'::timestamptz),
