('Kurt Keilhacker','General Partner','Elementum Ventures',array['$100K - $500K','$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M']::text[],array['BioTech','AI','Developer Tools','Climate']::text[],array['Seed']::text[],true,null,'kurt@elementum.vc',array['US/Canada','Europe','Israel']::text[],null,'https://www.linkedin.com/in/keilhacker/','Kurt is a startup veteran. He’s co-founded and served as Chairman, CEO, or CFO of companies throughout Silicon Valley and internationally. Kurt is driven by learning: he asks hard questions, studies toward solutions, and tests every answer so that the best ideas are made tangible for business. With multi-billion dollar exits and IPOs, Kurt has proven startup experience and he thrives on applying it to new and emerging markets. Before Elementum, Kurt founded and invested in more than 50 companies across the US and Europe through TechFund and TechFund Europe.','Menlo Park, California','2023-04-29T14:48:31.000Z'::timestamptz),
('Kush M Parmar','Managing Partner','5AM Ventures',array['$0 - $100K','$100K - $500K','$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M']::text[],array['BioTech']::text[],array['Seed','Series A']::text[],true,null,null,array['US/Canada']::text[],null,'https://www.linkedin.com/in/kush-parmar-m-d-ph-d-5165582/','Dr. Parmar serves as a Director on the Boards of Akouos (NASDAQ: AKUS), Ensoma, Entrada (NASDAQ: TRDA), GlycoEra, Homology (NASDAQ: FIXX), Rallybio (NASDAQ: RLYB) and Vor Biopharma (NASDAQ: VOR). Prior to 5AM, Dr. Parmar was at Harvard Medical School, where he was an NIH-sponsored M.D./Ph.D. Physician Scientist Fellow in the Harvard-MIT Health Sciences and Technology Program. He completed clinical clerkships at the Massachusetts General & Brigham and Women’s Hospitals. At Princeton University, Dr. Parmar worked on developmental genetics with Eric F. Wieschaus (Nobel Prize in Medicine in 1995).','Boston, Massachusetts','2023-04-29T14:49:26.000Z'::timestamptz),
('Kyle Doherty','Managing Director','General Catalyst',array['$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M','$10M - $50M']::text[],array['Enterprise','SaaS','Consumer','Digital Health','Web3','FinTech']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Series B+']::text[],true,'Canva; Instacart','kdoherty@generalcatalyst.com',array['US/Canada','India','Latin America']::text[],'https://twitter.com/kydoh','https://www.linkedin.com/in/kydoh/','Began career as an equity analyst immersed in the growth possibilities for tech companies that were already valued at tens of billions of dollars. Later focused on consumer internet investments at VC firm Morgenthaler and then joined Coatue Management, where he launched their private investment practice. Studied economics and finance at MIT and went on to earn an MBA from Harvard Business School.','San Francisco, California','2023-04-29T14:52:59.000Z'::timestamptz),
