('Lauren Wagner','Principal','Link Ventures',array['$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M']::text[],array['CPG/D2C','Enterprise','FinTech','Digital Health','AI','Developer Tools','Web3','Cybersecurity','Climate','Logistics']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Pre-seed']::text[],true,null,null,array['US/Canada','Israel']::text[],'https://twitter.com/typewriters','https://www.linkedin.com/in/laurenbwagner/','has over ten years of operating experience at startups, Google, and Meta where she built products that address complex societal issues. led product strategy and go-to-market for Meta’s privacy-protected APIs and data sets launched new digital products and a startup accelerator in emerging markets for Telefonica spearheading product strategy at Truveris','New York, New York','2023-04-29T15:30:59.000Z'::timestamptz),
('Laurene Powell Jobs','Founder and President','Emerson Collective',array['$0 - $100K','$100K - $500K','$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M']::text[],array['EdTech','Climate','Digital Health','FinTech','AI','Developer Tools','Enterprise']::text[],array['Seed','Pre-seed','Series A']::text[],true,'Color',null,array['US/Canada']::text[],'https://twitter.com/laurenepowell',null,'Powell Jobs shapes the vision of Emerson Collective, reviews impact, amplifies the momentum of its partners, and sets the operational direction of the organization. Many of the priorities championed by Emerson Collective are formed by the work of College Track, a program Powell Jobs founded in 1997 to prepare disadvantaged high school students for success in college. Today Powell Jobs is president of College Track’s board of directors, which now works with more than 2,000 students from Oakland, San Francisco, New Orleans, Los Angeles, and Aurora, Colorado. In addition to her work with Emerson Collective and College Track, she serves on the boards of directors of NewSchools Venture Fund, Teach for All, OZY Media, Conservation International and Stanford University. She also is a member of the Chairman’s advisory board of the Council on Foreign Relations.','Palo Alto, California','2023-04-29T15:33:36.000Z'::timestamptz),
