('M.G. Siegler','General Partner','GV',array['$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M','$10M - $50M']::text[],array['Enterprise','Social Networks','Consumer','BioTech','DeepTech']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Series B+']::text[],true,'Universe; Digit; Amino Apps; Anchor; Segment; The Players'' Tribune; Managed by Q; Aspen; Intercom; Slack; Stripe; Medium',null,array['US/Canada','Europe']::text[],'https://twitter.com/mgsiegler','https://www.linkedin.com/in/mgsiegler/','Deeply involved in the startup space since 2005, first as a web developer and then as a journalist, M.G. brings a reporter’s sensibility to his roles as an investor and startup advisor. M.G. credits his journalism background with a key quality he looks for today in founders: the ability to communicate well. “It’s an overlooked skill because a good idea doesn’t always translate into a viable product with users and customers. Storytelling – what you’re doing and why it matters – is incredibly important, whether convincing users to download your app, rallying your team behind a launch, or raising your next round of funding.” Before joining GV, M.G. was a founding partner at CrunchFund, an early-stage investment fund. Before that, he reported on the startup world for TechCrunch and VentureBeat. He still writes regularly for his Medium publication, 500ish.','San Francisco, California','2023-04-18T20:07:43.000Z'::timestamptz),
('Maarten ‘t Hooft','Managing Partner','Quest Venture Partners',array['$100K - $500K','$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M']::text[],array['SMB Software']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Pre-seed','Series B+']::text[],true,null,null,array['US/Canada']::text[],null,'https://www.linkedin.com/in/mthooft/','spent over 6 years at Google with 4 of those years on the Android team where he was responsible for the European launch of the G1 (first Android phone) and was the technical program manager for the Nexus S, Galaxy Nexus, and Nexus 7 devices.  Prior to joining Google, Maarten was working at Mercury software focusing on server side performance tuning, optimization and monitoring.','Menlo Park, California','2023-04-30T11:19:19.000Z'::timestamptz),
