('Sudhir Rao','Managing Partner - India','Celesta (fka WRVI)',array['$100K - $500K','$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M','$10M - $50M']::text[],array['Enterprise','Hardware','BioTech']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Series B+']::text[],true,null,'sudhir@indusage.com',array['USA','Latin America','Israel','India','Canada','Asia-Pacific','Europe','Africa','Australia/New Zealand','MENA']::text[],'https://twitter.com/sudhirindusage','https://www.linkedin.com/in/raosudhir/','In addition to his role as Managing Partner, India, of Celesta Capital, Sudhir Rao is also the founding managing partner of IndusAge Partners – an India and US focused venture fund. Sudhir has been a leading industry pioneer in the capital markets in India for over 33 years. He was one of the founding directors of Karvy Investor Services Ltd. and Karvy Stockbroking Ltd. involved in providing Investor Services, Merchant Banking and Retail Financial services.','India','2023-05-01T01:31:40.000Z'::timestamptz),
