('Talia Goldberg','Partner','Bessemer Venture Partners',array['$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M','$10M - $50M']::text[],array['Consumer','B2C/E-Commerce','Enterprise','IoT','Real Estate','Retail','SaaS','SMB Software','AI','Developer Tools','Cybersecurity','BioTech','Digital Health','FinTech']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Series B+']::text[],true,'Syndio Solutions; Friday; Retrica; Discord; Shippo; DeepL; Kindred; Rupa Health',null,array['USA','Canada','Israel','Asia-Pacific','Europe']::text[],'https://twitter.com/taliagold','https://www.linkedin.com/in/talia-goldberg-a3819431/','She is especially passionate about networks and platforms that create new categories and progress the way we live and work. She partners with ambitious entrepreneurs building radically better products with unique distribution models. Talia joined Bessemer in 2013 and later became the youngest elected partner in firm history.','San Francisco, California','2023-04-21T16:37:12.000Z'::timestamptz),
('Tamim Abdul Majid','General Partner','OCA
  Ventures',array['$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M']::text[],array['FinTech','Enterprise','Digital Health','B2C/E-Commerce']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Series B+']::text[],true,null,null,array['USA','Canada']::text[],null,'https://www.linkedin.com/in/tamim-abdul-majid/','Tamim Abdul Majid is a General Partner, specializing in Enterprise Software, Deep Tech, and Fintech investments. Tamim sits on the boards of various portfolio companies, including Genvid Technologies, Balto, Iris Automation, Curate, and Whitefox Defense. Prior to joining OCA Ventures, Tamim worked at a private strategic advisory firm helping companies secure international contracts with foreign national buyers. Tamim was also the financial lead for a payment start up called FreeBeePay. Before that, he was an investment banking analyst at BMO Capital Markets focusing on mergers and acquisitions, and a tax advisory associate at KPMG.','Austin, Texas','2023-04-26T08:38:58.000Z'::timestamptz),
('Tanay Jaipuria','Partner','Wing VC',array['$100K - $500K','$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M','$10M - $50M']::text[],array['BioTech','AI','Developer Tools','Web3','Digital Health','Cybersecurity']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Pre-seed','Series B+']::text[],true,null,'tanay@wing.vc',array['USA']::text[],'https://twitter.com/tanayj','https://www.linkedin.com/in/tanayjaipuria/','Tanay joins Wing from product at Meta, and focuses on investments in SaaS apps, B2B marketplaces, and Web3 infrastructure and tooling. In his product manager role at Meta, Tanay built products to help businesses better reach their prospective customers on Facebook, and to help creators make a living on Instagram. Before that, he was a consultant at McKinsey & Company where he served clients across the healthcare, financial services, and technology industries. Tanay brings a wealth of experiential knowledge to Wing, and shares his thoughts on startups, technology, and business in his popular weekly newsletter.','New York, New York','2023-04-21T16:22:07.000Z'::timestamptz),
('Tanya Beja','General Partner','AlleyCorp',array['$500K - $1M']::text[],array['Digital Health']::text[],array['Pre-seed','Seed','Series A']::text[],true,null,null,array['USA']::text[],null,'https://www.linkedin.com/in/tanya-beja/','Tanya is managing partner of AlleyCorp’s social impact fund, leading AlleyCorp’s investments and incubations in the social impact space. Tanya has extensive experience at the intersection of venture capital, venture philanthropy and social entrepreneurship. Prior to AlleyCorp, she worked at Blue Marble Microinsurance, Robin Hood Foundation, and IGNIA Partners. Tanya holds a master’s degree in public policy from the Harvard Kennedy School of Government and a BA summa cum laude from Tufts University.','New York, New York','2023-04-21T16:18:05.000Z'::timestamptz),
('Tasheen Rashid','Investor / Analyst','HOF Capital',array['$100K - $500K','$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M']::text[],array['Enterprise','AI','Developer Tools','FinTech','Cybersecurity','Digital Health','Future of Work','Climate']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Pre-seed','Series B+']::text[],true,null,null,array['USA','India','Africa','Latin America','Asia-Pacific','Europe','Canada','Israel','Australia/New Zealand','MENA']::text[],'https://mobile.twitter.com/tahseenrashid_','https://www.linkedin.com/in/tahseen-rashid/','focuses on enterprise software companies that leverage AI/ML and companies operating in emerging markets. Prior to HOF Capital, Tahseen worked on consulting engagements for Tiger Global, where he analyzed investment opportunities in emerging markets. Previously, he worked on the growth team at Kormo, an employment software platform supported by Google’s Next Billion Users initiative,','New York, New York','2023-04-21T15:58:35.000Z'::timestamptz),
