('Teddy Seem','Co-Managing Partner','Outsiders Fund',array['$500K - $1M','$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M']::text[],array['Enterprise','Digital Health','AI','Developer Tools','Logistics','Proptech','Cybersecurity']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Pre-seed']::text[],true,null,null,array['USA','Canada']::text[],null,'https://www.linkedin.com/in/theodore-seem-77949276/','Teddy Seem started his career at Bridgewater Associates where he was initially a forward deployed engineer before transitioning to an investment engineering role building the quantitative models for the Foreign Exchange research team. After Bridgewater, he pursued his interest in machine learning and led the machine learning initiatives at a NYC start-up called Resonance where he focused on building ML models which could interpret, convert and re-process 2-dimensional images.','Brooklyn, New York','2023-04-21T10:05:51.000Z'::timestamptz),
