('Yuriy Dovzhansky','Vice President & Principal','Victress Capital; Visible Ventures',array['$1M - $3M','$3M - $10M','$100K - $500K','$500K - $1M']::text[],array['Consumer','B2C/E-Commerce','Education','Enterprise','Entertainment','Health and Wellness','Healthcare/Medtech','InsureTech','B2B SaaS','Social Media','Digital Health','EdTech','CPG/D2C','Under-represented founders','Marketplaces']::text[],array['Seed','Series A','Pre-seed']::text[],true,'Daily Harvest; Droplette; Parade; Rae Wellness; Standard dOSE; Ello; Lucra; Recurate; Toucan','yuriy@visibleventures.com',array['US/Canada']::text[],null,'https://www.linkedin.com/in/yuriydovzhansky/','Yuriy is an Investor at Victress Capital, an early stage venture capital firm investing in high-growth companies meeting the needs of the evolving consumer. Previously, he was an investor at DNA Capital, a multi-stage healthcare fund focused on digital health and healthcare services and at SWAT Equity Partners, an early-stage venture capital firm focused on emerging consumer brands. Yuriy started his career as a management consultant, where he served companies in a variety of industries including retail, technology, and healthcare. Yuriy earned his MBA from the Stanford Graduate School of Business and his BBA from the University of Texas at Austin.','New York, New York','2023-10-12T15:13:47.000Z'::timestamptz),
